{% comment %}
  TRYMALORA - EDITORIAL PRODUCT FAQ (SECTION XIV.F)
  Dynamic per product: Custom FAQ accordion per product handle.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
  .tm-faq-section {
    padding: 72px 0;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
    font-family: var(--zv-font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-text, #2B1B24);
  }

  .tm-faq-header {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
  }

  .tm-faq-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 5px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--zv-radius-full, 9999px);
    background: var(--zv-pdp-tint, #F8E4EB);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    border: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .tm-faq-title {
    font-family: var(--zv-font-heading, 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 34px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-heading, #2B1B24);
    line-height: 1.18;
    letter-spacing: -0.6px;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 768px) {
    .tm-faq-title {
      font-size: 38px;
    }
  }

  .tm-faq-subtitle {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-body, #4A3841);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .tm-faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
  }

  .tm-faq-item {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--zv-pdp-line, #EAD7DD);
  }

  .tm-faq-summary {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 22px 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--zv-font-heading, 'Fraunces', Georgia, serif);
    font-size: 17.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-heading, #2B1B24);
    list-style: none;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .tm-faq-summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .tm-faq-ic {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--zv-pdp-surface, #FBEDE8);
    color: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: 16px;
  }

  .tm-faq-item[open] .tm-faq-ic {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    background: var(--zv-pdp-accent, #B0476E);
    color: #FFFFFF;
  }

  .tm-faq-body {
    padding: 0 0 20px;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--zv-pdp-body, #4A3841);
  }
</style>

<section class="tm-faq-section" id="tmFaqSection">
  <div class="zv-container" style="max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px;">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="tm-faq-header">
      <span class="tm-faq-chip">
        {{ section.settings.chip_text | default: "✦ COMMON QUESTIONS" }}
      </span>
      <h2 class="tm-faq-title">
        {{ section.settings.heading | default: "Frequently Asked Questions" }}
      </h2>
      <p class="tm-faq-subtitle">
        {% if section.settings.subtitle != blank %}
          {{ section.settings.subtitle }}
        {% elsif product.handle == 'christmas-lantern-welcome-gnome' %}
          Everything you need to know about porch placement, star lantern battery life, sizing, and our holiday guarantee.
        {% else %}
          Everything you need to know about applications, compatibility, curing, and store policies.
        {% endif %}
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion List -->
    <div class="tm-faq-list">
      {% if section.blocks.size > 0 %}
        {% for block in section.blocks %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" {% if block.settings.open_default %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>{{ block.settings.question }}</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              {{ block.settings.answer }}
            </div>
          </details>
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
        {% case product.handle %}
        {% when 'car-metal-rust-repair-paste' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Will this repair paste stop active rust from spreading?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes. The high-viscosity paste penetrates deep into microscopic metal fissures, creating an airtight and watertight chemical barrier that starves underlying iron of moisture and oxygen, effectively halting corrosion creep.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Do I need to sand down to bare shiny metal first?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              No extensive grinding is required. Simply scrape off loose, flaky paint and bubbling rust scale with a wire brush or scraper. The paste bonds directly over light surface oxidation.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can I wash my vehicle after application?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The surface becomes dry to the touch in 1–2 hours and water-resistant. However, we recommend waiting 24 hours for full chemical curing before high-pressure car washes or waxing.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Is this paste safe on vehicle factory clear coats?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes, it is non-corrosive to adjacent automotive paints. If any excess paste contacts unblemished paintwork, simply wipe it clean with the included microfiber towel before it dries.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'metal-chrome-polish-restorer-paste' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What metal surfaces is this chrome polish safe on?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              It is formulated for genuine chrome, stainless steel, polished aluminum, brass, and copper. It is not recommended for faux painted plastic trim or matte anodized finishes.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Will this polish remove deep scratches or gouges?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              It completely eliminates micro-scratches, swirl marks, yellowing, water spots, and surface corrosion. It will not fill structural gouges or missing metal.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Does it leave a protective coating after buffing?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes. Each application leaves behind a microscopic hydrophobic barrier that beads water, resists brake dust, and prevents immediate re-oxidation for months.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'mini-dual-purpose-travel-styling-iron' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can I use this styling iron overseas while traveling?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes! The iron features automatic dual voltage (110V–240V). It operates seamlessly in North America, Europe, Asia, and worldwide—all you need is a standard travel plug adapter.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How fast does it heat up and what temperature does it reach?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              It heats up in just 30 seconds using advanced PTC ceramic elements, maintaining a constant hair-safe styling temperature of 375°F (190°C) that protects strands while locking in long-lasting shape.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Is there an anti-scald safety feature?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes, the front tip of the iron is thermally insulated with heat-resistant composite material, allowing you to hold and twist the iron with both hands without burning your fingers.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'tile-refinishing-paint-restoration-kit', 'tile-refinishing-paint-restoration-kit-draft' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can this refinishing paint be used on wet shower walls?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes. Once fully cured (allow 48 hours before direct water contact), the high-gloss enamel forms an impermeable waterproof seal that withstands daily hot shower steam, scrubbing, and moisture.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How many coats are required for complete coverage?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              We recommend 2 thin, even coats with a 2-hour drying interval between coats. This provides optimal opacity and a porcelain-smooth finish that completely conceals dark stained grout.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Does this paint emit harsh chemical odors or toxic fumes?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              No. Unlike industrial epoxy coatings that require respirators, our formula is water-based, low-VOC, and virtually odorless, making it completely safe for residential bathrooms and kitchens.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'metallic-silver-anti-rust-renovation-coating' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can I apply this coating directly over rusted metal gates?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes. Simply brush away loose flaking rust scale. The water-based conversion polymers chemically bond directly to oxidized metal, sealing the rust and preventing further decay.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How weather-resistant is the cured silver finish?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              It is specifically formulated for outdoor architectural exposure. It resists heavy rainfall, intense UV sun rays, freezing temperatures, and humidity without peeling or cracking.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How much area does one 50g can cover?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              One 50g can covers approximately 5 to 6 square feet with a single coat, making it ideal for garden gates, outdoor railings, security grills, and exterior pipes.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'ear-cleaner' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Is it safe for both dogs and cats of any breed?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes, 100%. Our gentle botanical wash is veterinarian-crafted with soothing chamomile extract, pure aloe vera, and natural cleansing agents. It contains zero alcohol, zero harsh steroids, and zero stinging chemicals, making it completely safe for dogs, cats, puppies, and kittens of all breeds.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How often should I clean my pet's ears?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              For active buildup, itching, head shaking, or foul yeast odor, use once daily for 3–5 consecutive days until ears are calm and clear. For ongoing health maintenance and prevention, clean 1–2 times weekly.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Will the liquid sting or cause my pet discomfort?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Not at all. Unlike alcohol or peroxide flushes which burn raw skin, Trymalora is pH-balanced specifically for canine and feline skin. It actively cools inflammation and soothes irritated tissue on contact.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Why should I use wipes along with the ear cleaner?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The liquid ear cleaner flows deep into the 90-degree L-shaped canal to liquefy hardened wax and yeast. When your pet naturally shakes their head, loosened debris is propelled to the outer canal. Our textured Ear Finger Wipes allow you to gently wipe away the gunk in seconds without painful digging.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How does the 30-day auto-delivery subscription work?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              When you choose "Subscribe &amp; Deliver Every 30 Days", fresh bottles are automatically dispatched every 30 days to ensure your pet never suffers from recurring ear infections. You can pause, skip an order, or cancel anytime with 1-click in your account without penalties.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What is your 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              We stand behind TRYMALORA quality. If your pet's ears aren't noticeably cleaner, fresher, and itch-free within 30 days of delivery, contact us at support@trymalora.com for a full, hassle-free refund.
            </div>
          </details>


        {% when 'eyvelle-steam-therapy' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How does ultrasonic steam therapy treat dry eyes better than eye drops?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Over 86% of dry eyes are caused by Meibomian Gland Dysfunction (MGD), where tiny oil glands along your eyelids become clogged by hardened lipids. Liquid eye drops only add temporary moisture that washes away your natural tears and evaporates in 10–15 minutes. Trymalora's 40°C warm ultrasonic nano-mist penetrates directly into the eyelid margins, liquefying hardened oils and restoring your natural protective tear film.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What kind of water should I use in the reservoir?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              We recommend using distilled water, purified water, or sterile isotonic eye saline. Avoid using tap water or mineral water, as natural minerals can cause scale buildup inside the high-frequency ultrasonic atomizer over time.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Is the steam temperature safe for sensitive eyes and skin?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes, completely. The wand maintains a gentle, ophthalmologist-calibrated warmth of 40°C (104°F) — the exact therapeutic threshold required to safely melt meibomian wax without burning or irritating delicate eyelid tissue.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can I use this device with contact lenses or makeup?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              You can safely use the steam wand with soft or rigid contact lenses — many users find it provides instant comfort from lens-induced dryness. For best hygiene, we recommend removing heavy eye makeup or mascara prior to treatment to allow unobstructed steam access to your lash line.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How long does a session take and how often should I use it?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Each session lasts 3 to 5 minutes per eye. For active dry eyes, screen fatigue, or blepharitis, use 1–2 times daily (e.g. during a mid-work screen break and before bedtime). Once symptoms stabilize, 3–4 sessions per week maintain crystal-clear eye comfort.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How long does the battery last on a single charge?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The high-capacity lithium battery provides up to 75 minutes of continuous operation — equivalent to approximately 15 full 5-minute therapy sessions. It recharges rapidly in about 60 minutes via any standard USB-C port or charger.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How do I clean and sanitize the silicone eye cup?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The eye cup is made of food-grade, hypoallergenic medical silicone. Simply detach it from the wand and rinse under warm running water with mild soap after each use, or wipe with an alcohol-free sanitizing wipe and let air dry.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What is your 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee policy?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              We stand 100% behind Trymalora. If you do not experience soothing, noticeable relief from chronic dry eyes, computer eye strain, or eyelid irritation within 30 days of delivery, simply email us at support@trymalora.com for a prompt, hassle-free return and full refund.
            </div>
          </details>

        {% when 'christmas-lantern-welcome-gnome' %}
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can I place this gnome outside on my front porch?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes! The Christmas Lantern Welcome Gnome is ideally suited for covered front porches, sheltered entryways, verandas, and all indoor living areas. While the resin body and weighted base are sturdy and weather-tolerant, we recommend keeping him under a covered roof protected from direct driving rain and heavy snow to keep the knitted cap and botanical pinecones in pristine condition.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What type of batteries does the star lantern use and how long do they last?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The star lantern is powered by standard, easily replaceable batteries located inside a discreet compartment on the base. Thanks to energy-efficient warm-white LED diodes, a single set of batteries provides over 120 hours of continuous ambient starlight—easily lasting through the entire holiday season.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What are the exact dimensions and weight of the gnome?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The gnome stands approximately 14 inches (35 cm) tall with a base diameter of 6 inches (15 cm), weighing approximately 2.8 lbs (1.3 kg). The weighted composite base ensures he stands securely upright without easily tipping over from indoor drafts or playful pets.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How are the pinecones, greenery, and knitted hat constructed?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Each piece is crafted with meticulous attention to detail. The cap features a cozy ribbed red-and-cream knitted-style texture, the flowing snowy white beard is soft and plush, and the surrounding garland combines realistic frosted evergreen branches, genuine natural pinecones, and bright crimson winter berries for an authentic woodland feel.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How do I store the gnome after the holidays?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Your gnome arrives in a custom collector's storage box with protective foam inserts. When the holiday season concludes, simply remove the batteries and place the gnome back into the box to keep him clean, pristine, and ready for next year's celebrations.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What is your 60-Night Holiday Happiness Guarantee?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              We want this gnome to bring true joy and warmth to your holiday home. If you or your family aren't 100% delighted with the craftsmanship, starlight glow, and festive charm of your Christmas Lantern Welcome Gnome within 60 days of delivery, simply contact our concierge team at support@trymalora.com for a hassle-free return and full refund.
            </div>
          </details>
        {% else %}
          <!-- Default: Kids Infrared Laser Battle Set (Exact Preserved) -->
          <details class="tm-faq-item" open>
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Is the infrared beam safe for children and eyes?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes. The set utilizes certified optical infrared emission—the same safe, invisible light technology found in standard home TV remote controls. There are no hazardous high-powered laser diodes and zero physical dart or plastic projectiles, ensuring 100% eye-safe indoor family play.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>What age is the Laser Battle Set suitable for?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              The Laser Battle Set offers an exciting, interactive play experience for the whole family. This toy is not suitable for children under 2 years old.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>Can more than 2 players battle together?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Yes! By selecting the 2-pack (4 blasters) or 3-pack (6 blasters) bundle offers, you can sync unlimited blasters together across 4 distinct team color channels (Blue, Red, Green, White). Teammates on the same color frequency cannot damage each other, allowing coordinated group squad matches.
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="tm-faq-item">
            <summary class="tm-faq-summary">
              <span>How does the wall-target projector operate?</span>
              <span class="tm-faq-ic" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
            </summary>
            <div class="tm-faq-body">
              Place the projector on a table or the floor pointed at any light wall or ceiling in a slightly dimmed room. When switched on, it projects moving animated targets across 180° of elevation. Players aim and fire at the projections—hits register with distinct arcade sounds and flashing hit lights.
            </div>
          </details>
      {% endcase %}
      {% endif %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

